Did you hear me?

269
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,620
I said stay back! Please.

270
00:17:57,340 --> 00:17:59,869
Please, it's time to
stop the fighting now.

271
00:18:01,780 --> 00:18:02,610
Why?

272
00:18:02,693 --> 00:18:03,523
Why are you doing that?

273
00:18:03,606 --> 00:18:04,436
Please get back!

274
00:18:04,519 --> 00:18:06,777
It's up to us to end the cycle of hatred.

275
00:18:06,860 --> 00:18:09,117
If we don't work to end
the sorrow this time,

276
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:11,847
then the cycle of pain
will just continue on.

277
00:18:12,540 --> 00:18:13,834
When we were all born,

278
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:17,201
were any of us made to
steal or cause others harm?

279
00:18:57,580 --> 00:18:58,410
That's it!

280
00:18:58,493 --> 00:18:59,323
It's gotta be!

281
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:01,060
Hey, wait!

282
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:03,480
What are you doing?

283
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:12,637
People have many different
ways of thinking.

284
00:19:12,720 --> 00:19:14,380
Even if a mistake is made,

285
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:19,337
as long as a person realizes their mistake,
it's possible to make it right again.

286
00:19:19,420 --> 00:19:22,891
And if you keep your vision
clear, you will see the future.

287
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:25,265
This is what one must realize.

288
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:27,802
Right, Grandma?

289
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:31,097
I hate to ask, but how long
are you planning to do this?

290
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:33,500
Oh, this is a great day!

291
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:36,640
Let me go!

292
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:38,980
Let me go, baby! You forget!

293
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,668
Hey, I'm injured, remember?

294
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:13,980
The red flower Rem loved, the geranium,

295
00:20:14,340 --> 00:20:18,580
and the language of flowers
means determination.

296
00:20:22,380 --> 00:20:24,020
I made it again.

297
00:20:25,780 --> 00:20:27,260
This one's yours.

298
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:40,960
You're going, aren't you?

299
00:20:42,840 --> 00:20:43,670
Yeah.

300
00:20:45,520 --> 00:20:47,300
I'm feeling a lot better now.

301
00:20:47,800 --> 00:20:48,630
Don't worry, I'll be back.

302
00:20:48,713 --> 00:20:53,557
be okay see you later good luck

303
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:56,557
Thanks and thanks for everything

304
00:20:56,640 --> 00:21:03,640
I

305
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:06,470
want

306
00:21:06,553 --> 00:21:07,837
you to take this with

307
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,397
you I know it would make mr.

308
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:12,068
wolf would happy in
fact it would Honor him.

309
00:21:13,320 --> 00:21:15,700
Are you sure about this? I am.

310
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:19,980
Wow, this is pretty heavy.

311
00:21:20,540 --> 00:21:21,820
Yeah, it is!

312
00:21:22,140 --> 00:21:23,520
Of course it's heavy.

313
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:25,680
That's because it's full of mercy.

314
00:21:27,260 --> 00:21:29,500
Well, take care of yourselves. Bye.

315
00:21:44,960 --> 00:21:46,117
I couldn't...

316
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:51,000
I couldn't say anything to him.

317
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:58,677
Well, you can tell him
everything when he gets back!

318
00:21:58,760 --> 00:22:00,160
You can go nuts on him!

319
00:22:17,080 --> 00:22:18,677
I finally understand.

320
00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:20,957
It was the last thing
she tried to tell me.

321
00:22:21,040 --> 00:22:22,800
I will never go wrong again.

322
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:28,440
Humans are survivors, so
I will take care of him.

323
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:31,700
I'll save nights.

324
00:23:32,280 --> 00:23:35,157
I'm not sure what's going on,

325
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:41,000
but I'm not sure what's going on.

326
00:24:05,820 --> 00:24:11,620
That day, that time, 130 years
ago, we were born, weren't we?

327
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:16,640
There was nothing but peaceful days,
and Rem was always close behind us.

328
00:24:17,160 --> 00:24:21,572
But our disagreeing thoughts changed
each of our ways of life, didn't they?

329
00:24:21,900 --> 00:24:23,140
I don't regret it.

330
00:24:23,460 --> 00:24:28,120
I will vow once again not to kill,
not to betray, but to find happiness,

331
00:24:28,500 --> 00:24:34,320
to talk about my dreams, because the
ticket to the future is always blank.
